    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d188">

                <pb facs="0413" n="297" xml:id="pg297"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">710.E/190: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Sterling</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-03-06T10:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">March 6,
                                1923—10 a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 12:42
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>10. With reference to previous correspondence on this subject, President Leguía
                    told me yesterday that to his great regret Peru would be unable, in the present
                    circumstances, to attend the conference at Santiago.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sterling</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
